# The control-plane image contains only Go binaries and migrations. Keeping
# local console output, dependencies, secrets, and design artefacts outside
# the build context makes a rebuild deterministic and prevents accidental
# inclusion of workstation state in a deployment image.
.git
.github
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.log
.DS_Store

apps
docs
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/dist
**/.turbo

tmp
temp
vendor
